{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07539","headline":"咏史十一首 一 · 李华","name":"咏史十一首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昂藏獬豸兽，出自太平年。\n乱代乃潜伏，纵人爲祸愆。\n尝闻断马劒，每壮朱云贤。\n身死名不灭，寒风吹[墓]田。\n精灵如有在，幽愤满松烟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李华","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07539.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07539","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}